{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-memory#card-zh","repo":"flymysql/dsh-memory","commit":"295d173e4a7999005be910af5fe7d72ca1dd82a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-vault 是为 DSH Web 客户端提供跨会话记忆的插件。它把记忆条目保存在 dsh_memory 存储域中，注册 memory_remember、memory_recall 和 memory_forget 三个模型工具，并将最近条目加入每轮系统提示。用户可以记下事实、偏好、决定和项目笔记，之后按关键词或标签检索，也可按 ID 或标签删除。设置页还支持浏览、快速添加和删除记忆。适合希望 Agent 在新会话中延续项目背景与用户偏好的 DSH 用户；需在配置中接入存储、工具、系统提示及可选的 Web 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-51","lib/index.js:257-283","lib/client.js:98-129"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-memory#card-en","repo":"flymysql/dsh-memory","commit":"295d173e4a7999005be910af5fe7d72ca1dd82a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory-vault gives DSH agents persistent memory across sessions. It stores notes, offers tools to save, search, and delete them, and injects recent entries into each system prompt. A Settings page supports memory management. It suits users who want DSH to retain project facts and preferences.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-51","lib/index.js:257-283","lib/client.js:98-129"]}
