{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-memory#feature-settings-page","repo":"flymysql/dsh-memory","commit":"295d173e4a7999005be910af5fe7d72ca1dd82a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-vault 的功能「网页管理页」：DSH 设置中的“记忆库”页面列出条目，提供快速添加和删除按钮，并通过同源 JSON 路由读写记忆。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:98-129"]}
{"unit_id":"flymysql__dsh-memory#feature-tuning","repo":"flymysql/dsh-memory","commit":"295d173e4a7999005be910af5fe7d72ca1dd82a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-vault 的功能「注入与检索条数配置」：部署配置可设置 injectLimit 控制每轮提示注入条数，并设置 recallLimit 限制 memory_recall 返回条数；两项都有默认值和范围校验。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-35"]}
